    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017438
    m_Localized: RE-PLACE BOARD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017439
    m_Localized: LANGUAGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017440
    m_Localized: MUSIC
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017441
    m_Localized: EFFECTS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017442
    m_Localized: BACK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017443
    m_Localized: Pinch to put the board here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017444
    m_Localized: 'No table found. Pinch to place the board here,

      or run Space Setup in the headset settings.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017445
    m_Localized: Look at a table
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017446
    m_Localized: Pinch the lit piece in the tray and drop it on the ring. The next rail goes here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017447
    m_Localized: 'Next: the lit piece, onto the ring.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017448
    m_Localized: Now try the lit piece here. It does not join the rail beside it. Watch the ghost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017449
    m_Localized: 'It flew back: a rail next to track must join it. Now the lit one.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017450
    m_Localized: Each number counts rails. That line now holds exactly as many as it asks for.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017451
    m_Localized: Now lay one in the wrong place on purpose. Find the piece that fits this square.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017452
    m_Localized: 'That number has turned red: too many rails in its line. Pinch the rail to lift it off.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017453
    m_Localized: Throw it away, or let it go off the board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017454
    m_Localized: You have it. Follow the ring to the end of the line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017455
    m_Localized: Next rail here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017456
    m_Localized: This one first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017457
    m_Localized: Take the lit piece.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017458
    m_Localized: That rail was laid before you arrived. Lift one of your own.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017459
    m_Localized: That line holds more rails than its number allows. Lift one off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017460
    m_Localized: THE LINE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017461
    m_Localized: Ashgate has no railway yet. Lay one piece of track per square so the line runs from the S tunnel to the E tunnel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017462
    m_Localized: THE NUMBERS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017463
    m_Localized: 'Each number says how many pieces its row or column must hold. Exactly that many: it turns green when the count is right and red when it is over.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017464
    m_Localized: DEPARTURE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017465
    m_Localized: "When the track joins S to E and every number is matched, the train runs. Take your time \u2014 the clock only decides your stars."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017466
    m_Localized: NEXT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3504017467
    m_Localized: START
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 318851079933952
    m_Localized: You can move this board. Bring your hands to the rail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 318851151237120
    m_Localized: Pinch the rail with both hands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 318851151237121
    m_Localized: Move your hands to carry it. Spread or close them to resize it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 318851151237122
    m_Localized: THE BOARD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 318851151237123
    m_Localized: This board goes wherever you want it. Pinch its rail with both hands, one on each side, then carry it, turn it, or pull your hands apart to make it bigger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 318851151237124
    m_Localized: SKIP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 318851151237125
    m_Localized: PLACE IT AGAIN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 318851151237126
    m_Localized: To place the board afresh at any time, press the button on the back of your wrist to pause, then choose SETTINGS and RE-PLACE BOARD.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 318851151237127
    m_Localized: GOT IT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
